WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:02.211
I'm not who I used to be.

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:04.505
I'm something more.

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:16.058
It's time I told you the truth
about Leanne Grayson.

00:00:20.062 --> 00:00:21.605
When she first came to this house…

00:00:23.232 --> 00:00:25.108
it was an act of love.

00:00:27.528 --> 00:00:29.696
But that love was a selfish love.

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:35.577
It has brought death
and destruction down upon us all.

00:00:40.374 --> 00:00:42.459
People keep getting hurt in this house.

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:47.464
It's Leanne.

00:00:48.632 --> 00:00:50.175
When she's happy, things are good.

00:00:52.511 --> 00:00:54.221
When she's angry, things go bad.

00:00:59.268 --> 00:01:00.769
I'm not who I used to be.

00:01:04.439 --> 00:01:05.941
She scares me.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:09.987
I’m something more.

00:01:12.823 --> 00:01:14.783
I hurt people when I get angry.

00:01:20.414 --> 00:01:23.834
The scariest part is that I'm starting
to like the way that it feels.

00:01:31.175 --> 00:01:32.801
It's her or us.

00:01:36.805 --> 00:01:38.056
If she wins…

00:01:39.308 --> 00:01:42.394
the city will fall, and that's
only the beginning.

00:01:44.146 --> 00:01:46.106
Just when I thought you couldn't
make this any more disgusting

00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:47.441
and morally abhorrent.

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:54.907
Do you wanna hear a secret, Dorothy?

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:02.581
Jericho… shhh.

